Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:01:24.00,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}梅德韦杰夫 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs40}6{\r\fnTL Score\fs40\c&H9CA793&\b0}-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs40}4 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs40}7{\r\fnTL Score\fs40\c&H9CA793&\b0}-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs40}5{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 西西帕斯 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.60,0:00:02.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Great match, Daniil.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.60,0:00:02.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,打得漂亮 丹尼尔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.56,0:00:04.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations. He almost seemed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.56,0:00:04.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜 你好像
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.32,0:00:05.36,EN,,0,0,0,,to have a lot of success
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.32,0:00:05.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,很擅长打西西帕斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.36,0:00:07.20,EN,,0,0,0,,against Stefanos, read his game.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.36,0:00:07.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,把他的球路摸得很透
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.20,0:00:07.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.20,0:00:07.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.44,0:00:09.76,EN,,0,0,0,,what did you do particularly well tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.44,0:00:09.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚你哪方面做得特别好？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.76,0:00:11.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah. first of all, super strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.76,0:00:11.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 首先 太奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.92,0:00:13.68,EN,,0,0,0,,The court is like three times faster
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.92,0:00:13.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,这块球场比另一块
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:15.20,EN,,0,0,0,,than the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:15.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,快了大概三倍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:17.60,EN,,0,0,0,,And so when I heard Novak
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:17.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以当我听到诺瓦克
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.60,0:00:18.88,EN,,0,0,0,,after his match and he said the court
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.60,0:00:18.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,赛后说这块球场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.88,0:00:20.56,EN,,0,0,0,,I thought
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.88,0:00:20.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,比北京快多了 我想 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.56,0:00:21.20,EN,,0,0,0,,let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.56,0:00:21.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,走着瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.20,0:00:22.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow I played but I played
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.20,0:00:22.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,第二天我上场了 但我是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.40,0:00:23.44,EN,,0,0,0,,on Grandstand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.40,0:00:23.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,在副场打的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.44,0:00:24.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I was like what is he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.44,0:00:24.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就想 他在说什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.80,0:00:27.36,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean it's same or even slower.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.80,0:00:27.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得一样快 甚至更慢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:29.04,EN,,0,0,0,,And this one on the warm-up, I was like,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:29.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,而这一场 热身时我就
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.04,0:00:31.44,EN,,0,0,0,,"Jesus Christ, it's so fast." Which is good
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.04,0:00:31.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,“天哪 太快了 ”这对我是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:33.36,EN,,0,0,0,,for me, but I needed, you know, to reset
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:33.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,好事 但我得重新调整
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.36,0:00:34.96,EN,,0,0,0,,because it's completely different court
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.36,0:00:34.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为这块球场跟之前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.96,0:00:36.80,EN,,0,0,0,,from what I played before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.96,0:00:36.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,打的完全不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.80,0:00:37.92,EN,,0,0,0,,But that helped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.80,0:00:37.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,但这帮到了我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.92,0:00:39.28,EN,,0,0,0,,I think I played really aggressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.92,0:00:39.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得我打得很有攻击性
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.28,0:00:40.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I put a lot of pressure on him
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.28,0:00:40.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,给了他很大压力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.80,0:00:43.12,EN,,0,0,0,,and managed to beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.80,0:00:43.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,最终拿下了他
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.12,0:00:44.48,EN,,0,0,0,,We know we love this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.12,0:00:44.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们知道你很爱这项赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.48,0:00:45.52,EN,,0,0,0,,You're a former champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.48,0:00:45.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是前冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.52,0:00:47.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Went deep last year again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.52,0:00:47.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,去年又走得很远
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.28,0:00:48.32,EN,,0,0,0,,in the quarterfinals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.28,0:00:48.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,进了八强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.32,0:00:50.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Now, how much momentum do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.32,0:00:50.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在 你觉得势头如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.64,0:00:52.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I love I love Shanghai as a city.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.64,0:00:52.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的很爱上海这座城市
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.24,0:00:54.96,EN,,0,0,0,,The road is long to the to the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.24,0:00:54.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,进城的路很长
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.96,0:00:57.52,EN,,0,0,0,,but I enjoy I enjoy it a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.96,0:00:57.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我非常享受
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.52,0:01:00.00,EN,,0,0,0,,and probably one of my favorite stops
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.52,0:01:00.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,这里可能是我巡回赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:00.56,EN,,0,0,0,,on tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:00.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,最喜欢的几站之一
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.56,0:01:03.20,EN,,0,0,0,,So just trying to stay as long as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.56,0:01:03.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以就想尽可能待久一点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.20,0:01:03.92,EN,,0,0,0,,And how do you feel
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.20,0:01:03.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,那这周
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.92,0:01:05.20,EN,,0,0,0,,about your game this week?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.92,0:01:05.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,你对自己的状态感觉如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.20,0:01:06.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Playing great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.20,0:01:06.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.72,0:01:08.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Again today like it's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.72,0:01:08.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天又是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.24,0:01:10.80,EN,,0,0,0,,a completely different game style
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.24,0:01:10.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟副场完全是两种打法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.80,0:01:12.40,EN,,0,0,0,,than what you play on a grand stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.80,0:01:12.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我打得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:14.32,EN,,0,0,0,,but I played great, served great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:14.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,发球也很好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:16.56,EN,,0,0,0,,I think zero break points to save.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:16.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得一个破发点都没送
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.56,0:01:18.08,EN,,0,0,0,,So pretty happy about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.56,0:01:18.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.08,0:01:18.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Congrats, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.08,0:01:18.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜 兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.96,0:01:20.78,EN,,0,0,0,,Thanks. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.96,0:01:20.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢
